1
00:00:00,576 --> 00:00:04,066
(Leonard:)- Let's just go to your place.
- Lf he's unhappy, shouldn't we talk to him?

2
00:00:04,246 --> 00:00:07,576
"Shouldn't we talk to him?"
Have you learned nothing in six years?

3
00:00:13,956 --> 00:00:15,756
(Penny(entering apartment):)You doing okay, sweetie?

4
00:00:19,495 --> 00:00:23,595
There's ominous music playing
and there's an afghan over my head.

5
00:00:23,766 --> 00:00:27,726
(Sheldon:)I don't know where you're from, but where
I'm from, that means I'm not doing okay.

6
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:32,000
- I'm gonna make you some tea.
- Tea is for when I'm upset. I'm not upset.

7
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:36,338
The university is forcing me
to work with Kripke. I'm outraged.

8
00:00:37,212 --> 00:00:38,942
(Leonard:)So cocoa?

9
00:00:39,114 --> 00:00:40,344
(Sheldon:)Yes, cocoa.

10
00:00:42,751 --> 00:00:46,911
(Sheldon:)Do you have any idea what it's like
to be paired with someone so annoying?

11
00:00:47,089 --> 00:00:49,849
Oh, teacher, me, me.

12
00:00:51,827 --> 00:00:55,487
You see, I did all this great work
and now he's just gonna come and ruin it.

13
00:00:55,664 --> 00:00:58,534
I'm angrier than ever
and filled with despair.

